<#ftl output_format="HTML" auto_esc=true>
<!doctype html><html lang="${scalar(r.metadata.language)}"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta http-equiv="Content-Security-Policy" content="default-src 'none'; style-src 'self'; base-uri 'none'; form-action 'none'"><title>${l("幹部向け調査報告", "Executive investigation report")}</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="report.css"></head><body><header><p>WebAudit ${scalar(r.analysis.version)} · ${scalar(r.decision_support.version)}</p><h1>${l("幹部向け調査報告", "Executive investigation report")}</h1><p>${scalar(r.metadata.system)} · ${scalar(r.metadata.title)}</p><nav><a href="technical-report.html">${l("技術者向け報告", "Technical report")}</a> · <a href="index.html">${l("成果物一覧", "Artifact index")}</a></nav></header><main>
<p class="notice"><#if truth(r.complete)>${l("受領した入力の解析は完了。全アクセスの収集を保証するものではありません。", "Analysis of supplied inputs completed; complete collection of all access is not established.")}<#else>${l("部分解析または評価不能。件数は下限や未評価を含み、調査範囲の確認が必要です。", "Partial analysis or unavailable evaluation. Counts may be lower bounds or unevaluated; inspect the actual scope.")}</#if> ${l("件数品質", "Count quality")}: ${scalar(r.count_quality)} · ${l("全件証跡の完全性", "Full request evidence complete")}: ${scalar(r.evidence_complete)}</p><section><h2>01 ${l("結論と推奨対応", "Conclusion / Recommended response")}</h2><p class="level">${scalar(r.decision_support.response_label)}</p><p>${scalar(r.decision_support.reason)}</p><p class="notice">${scalar(r.decision_support.confirmed_impact)}</p><table><tr><th>${l("解析成功行", "Parsed observations")}</th><th>${l("不審要求", "Suspicious observations")}</th><th>${l("WebAudit事案", "WebAudit incidents")}</th><th>${l("優先調査事案", "Priority incidents")}</th></tr><tr><td>${scalar(r.summary.total_requests)}</td><td>${scalar(r.summary.suspicious_requests)}</td><td>${scalar(r.summary.findings)}</td><td>${scalar(r.summary.priority_findings)}</td></tr></table><p>${l("件数はログ観測です。独立エンジンの検出と合算して一意の攻撃数にしません。部分解析や下限は技術報告で確認してください。", "Counts describe log observations. Do not add independent-engine detections as unique attacks; inspect partial analysis and lower bounds in the technical report.")}</p><div class="charts"><#list r.summary.outcome_counts as key, n><p>${label(key)}: ${scalar(n)} <meter min="0" max="<#if truth(r.summary.findings)>${scalar(r.summary.findings)}<#else>1</#if>" value="${scalar(n)}">${scalar(n)}</meter></p></#list></div></section>
<p>${l("本文のリスク・対応表は調査優先度順の上位10対象まで。全保持対象は", "Risk/action tables show at most 10 targets in investigation-priority order. Total retained targets:")} ${r.secondary_investigation.cases?size?c}${l("対象。", " targets.")}<a href="technical-report.html#audience-evidence">${l("全対象の技術的根拠", "Technical evidence for all targets")}</a> · <a href="risk-register.csv">CSV</a></p><section id="risk-overview"><h2>02 ${l("潜在リスクと根拠", "Conditional risks and evidence")}</h2><p>${l("組織固有の重大度・被害額・成功確率は未評価です。下表は条件付きシナリオで、調査優先度は経営リスク評価ではありません。", "Organizational severity, loss and success probabilities are unevaluated. These are conditional scenarios; investigation priority is not a business-risk rating.")}</p><div class="table"><table><tr><th>${l("リスク・関連事案", "Risk and case")}</th><th>${l("優先度と理由", "Priority and reason")}</th><th>${l("条件・影響", "Condition and impact")}</th><th>${l("次の確認", "Next review")}</th></tr><#list r.decision_support.risks as item2><tr id="${scalar(item2.id)}"><td>${scalar(item2.title)}<br><a href="technical-report.html#review-${scalar(item2.case_id)}">${scalar(item2.case_id)}</a><br>${label(item2.kind)} / ${label(item2.outcome)}</td><td>${label(item2.priority)}<br>${scalar(item2.priority_reason)}</td><td>${scalar(item2.condition)}<br>${scalar(item2.conditional_impact)}</td><td>${scalar(item2.next_action)}</td></tr><#else><tr><td colspan="4">${l("保持された候補なし。未評価範囲と完全性を確認してください。", "No retained candidates; review unevaluated scope and completeness.")}</td></tr></#list></table></div></section>
<section><h2>03 ${l("対応方針と承認事項", "Response options and approvals")}</h2><table><tr><th>${l("方針", "Option")}</th><th>${l("利点と懸念", "Benefit and tradeoff")}</th><th>${l("適用条件", "When to consider")}</th></tr><tr><td>${l("対象を絞った追加調査", "Targeted investigation")}</td><td>${l("業務変更を抑えて不確実性を減らす。担当者の工数と追加資料が必要。", "Reduces uncertainty with limited operational changes; needs investigator time and records.")}</td><td><#if r.decision_support.response_level == "monitor">${l("現在は追加調査対象なし。新たな根拠が得られた場合に検討。", "No current investigation targets; consider if new evidence emerges.")}<#else>${scalar(r.decision_support.response_label)}</#if></td></tr><tr><td>${l("監視継続", "Continue monitoring")}</td><td>${l("業務影響は抑えられるが、既存の侵害を未確認のまま残す可能性。", "Limits operational disruption but may leave an existing compromise unresolved.")}</td><td>${l("優先候補がある場合、監視のみでの終了は非推奨。", "With priority candidates, monitoring alone is not a recommended closure.")}</td></tr><#if truth(r.decision_support.risks)><tr><td>${l("暫定制限・詳細調査", "Interim restrictions or detailed investigation")}</td><td>${l("継続する被害を抑える可能性と、正規利用・工数への影響を比較。", "Balance possible containment against legitimate-use disruption and investigation effort.")}</td><td>${l("追加証拠と現在の状態、業務影響を責任者が確認して判断。全停止を自動推奨しない。", "An owner reviews additional evidence, current state and business effects; no automatic full shutdown recommendation.")}</td></tr></#if></table><#if r.decision_support.response_level == "monitor"><p class="notice">${l("候補なしのため、追加調査の承認を自動要求しません。評価範囲と記録継続・監視方針を確認してください。安全の確定やリスク受容を意味しません。", "No candidates: no automatic request to authorize additional investigation. Review evaluated scope, logging and monitoring; this is not verified safety or risk acceptance.")}</p><#elseif r.decision_support.response_level == "hold"><p class="notice">${l("まず入力の形式・対象期間・欠損・評価範囲の確認と再解析を指示してください。確認できる候補は範囲を限定して調査し、責任者・担当・報告条件を設定してください。", "First request input-format, period, missing-record and scope checks and reanalysis. Investigate available candidates within stated limits and assign an owner and reporting conditions.")}</p><#else><p class="notice">${l("承認・指示事項：関連証拠の保全、必要資料の収集と二次調査、責任者・担当・報告期限の設定。全体の終了やリスク受容は責任者が判断してください。", "Approvals: preserve evidence, authorize required collection and secondary investigation, assign owners and reporting deadlines. A responsible owner decides closure or risk acceptance.")}</p></#if></section>
<section><h2>04 ${l("アクション・二次調査の実施計画", "Actions and secondary investigation plan")}</h2><p>${l("まず原本・取得元・ハッシュ・保管期限を確認し、関連記録を保全してください。担当候補と時期は提案であり、割当・承認済みではありません。", "First verify originals, provenance, hashes and retention and preserve relevant records. Suggested roles/timing are not assigned or approved.")}</p><div class="table"><table><tr><th>${l("対象・対応", "Case and action")}</th><th>${l("時期・担当候補", "Suggested timing and owner")}</th><th>${l("必要資料", "Materials to seek")}</th><th>${l("完了条件", "Completion condition")}</th></tr><#list r.decision_support.actions as item3><tr><td><a href="technical-report.html#review-${scalar(item3.case_id)}">${scalar(item3.case_id)}</a><br>${scalar(item3.action)}</td><td>${scalar(item3.suggested_timing)}<br>${scalar(item3.suggested_owner)}</td><td><#list item3.materials as item4>${scalar(item4)}<br></#list></td><td>${scalar(item3.completion_condition)}<br>${label(item3.status)}</td></tr></#list></table></div><p><a href="technical-report.html#secondary-investigation">${l("技術者向け：対象事案を選んで依頼プロンプトを生成", "Technical report: select cases and generate a request prompt")}</a> · <a href="action-plan.csv">CSV</a></p></section>
<section><h2>05 ${l("判断条件・終了条件・分析限界", "Decision conditions, closure and limitations")}</h2><#list r.decision_support.risks as item5><details><summary>${scalar(item5.case_id)} · ${scalar(item5.title)}</summary><p>${l("引き上げ条件", "Escalation")}: ${scalar(item5.escalation_condition)}</p><p>${l("対応を見送る場合", "If deferred")}: ${scalar(item5.if_deferred)}</p></details></#list><h3>${l("調査終了を検討できる条件", "Conditions for considering closure")}</h3><ul><#list r.decision_support.closure_conditions as item6><li>${scalar(item6)}</li></#list></ul><h3>${l("判断上の制約", "Decision limits")}</h3><ul><#list r.decision_support.limitations as item7><li>${scalar(item7)}</li></#list></ul><details><summary>${l("推奨対応レベルの適用条件", "Response-level criteria")}</summary><table><#list r.decision_support.response_rules as item8><tr><th>${scalar(item8.code)}</th><td>${scalar(item8.condition)}</td></tr></#list></table></details><p>${l("三次調査：二次調査でも成否・範囲が解決しない場合、必要なホスト・DB・フォレンジック証拠と調査目的を明示し、責任者に実施判断を求めてください。", "Tertiary investigation: if outcomes or scope remain unresolved, identify the required host/database/forensic evidence and objectives and seek the responsible owner's decision.")}</p><p><a href="risk-rules.json">${scalar(r.decision_support.version)}</a> · <a href="report.json">JSON</a> · <a href="manifest.json">${l("完全性情報", "Integrity manifest")}</a></p></section>
</main></body></html>
